1. COMPILATION & BUILD COMMANDS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
make all            : Builds directory tree and all rungs (Stage 0 to Stage C)
make stage0         : Builds Stage 0 O0 and O2 baseline binaries
make test_tradeio   : Builds standalone trade_io module test
make test_vwap      : Builds standalone VWAP indicator test
make test_ohlc      : Builds standalone OHLC bar indicator test
make test_sma       : Builds standalone SMA indicator test
make test_signal    : Builds standalone Signal Crossover test
make stageA         : Builds Stage A streaming engine (trade_io)
make stageA_plus    : Builds Stage A+ fast parser engine (fast_reader)
make stageB         : Builds Stage B static array engine (RAM)
make stageB_fp      : Builds Stage B fixed-point integer engine (long long)
make stageB_malloc  : Builds Stage B dynamic memory allocation engine
make stageC         : Builds Stage C real-time replay & rival bot engine


