3. PLOT & GRAPH GENERATION COMMANDS (BUILD + RUN + GNUPLOT)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
make plot_stageA        : Generates plots/signals_stageA.png
make plot_stageA_plus   : Generates plots/signals.png
make plot_stageB        : Generates plots/signals_stageB.png
make plot_stageB_fp     : Generates plots/signals_stageB_fp.png
make plot_stageB_malloc : Generates plots/signals_stageB_malloc.png
make plot_stageC        : Generates plots/rival_sweep.png


4. CLEANUP & MAINTENANCE COMMANDS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
make clean              : Removes bin/ and plots/ directories
make clean && make all  : Complete fresh rebuild of all targets
